# WIN-INSTALL-CONTRACT — Phase 0 follow-up, sub-agent N

File: openOODA/audit/win_install_contract.oot
Siblings: win_install_contract_map.oot (§4-6), win_install_contract_phase4.oot (§7-10).

Read-only walk of `ooda/install/` to extract a contract for `install_win.oo`.
Source: `openOODA/ooda/install/*.oo` + `openOODA/ooda/install/BOOTSTRAP_PIN` +
`openOODA/ooda/scripts/install_xdg_smoke.oo` + `openOODA/ooda/cli/cmd_more.oo`.
Date: 2026-08-19. Lane owner: cli (Windows variant is cli territory).
Active install path: `install.oo` -> `install_xdg.oo` -> `install_art.oo`.

## 0. Headline

`install.oo` (45 lines) imports only `install_art.oo` + `install_xdg.oo`. It does
**not** import `chapters_a.oo`, `chapters_b.oo`, `layout.oo`, or `util.oo`. Those
four files (504 lines total) are **residual** - still on disk, still documented
in `README.oot`, but not wired into the entry the cli or the smoke runs. A
Windows variant of `install.oo` therefore only needs to mirror `install.oo` +
`install_xdg.oo` (+ the art used by both). Carrying `chapters_*` across is
optional Phase 4+ work, not minimum.

The cli dispatch is at `cli/cmd_more.oo:51-66`. It builds
`OODA_SRC_ROOT=... OODA_CHECKOUT=... OODA_COMPILER=... OODAC_BIN=... oodac run
install/install.oo` and runs it via `sh -c`. Windows Phase 4 will need to pick
either Git-Bash, WSL, or a native Win32 launcher; the audit does not pick for
the cli owner.

## 1. Per-file function table

| File | Lines | Function | Lines | Job |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `install.oo` | 45 | `main(p, fw, env)` | 16-44 | Banner, read `OODA_FS_WRITEDIR` + `OODA_CHECKOUT`, call `install_xdg`, print next-step hint. |
| `install_xdg.oo` | 118 | `home_or(env)` | 14-20 | Read `OODA_FS_WRITEDIR`; return `""` if absent. |
| `install_xdg.oo` | 118 | `install_xdg(p, fw, env, checkout)` | 22-117 | The XDG install. Resolves paths, `test -x` checks, `mkdir -p`, `cp -f`/`cp -a`, `chmod +x`, `rm -rf`, writes `env` + `INSTALL_RECEIPT.txt`. |
| `install_art.oo` | 79 | `ink(p, code)` | 12-17 | `printf '\033[<code>m'` via `process_exec`. |
| `install_art.oo` | 79 | `ink_reset` | 19-21 | `ink(p, "0")`. |
| `install_art.oo` | 79 | `ink_cyan` | 23-25 | `1;38;5;51`. |
| `install_art.oo` | 79 | `ink_violet` | 27-29 | `1;38;5;141`. |
| `install_art.oo` | 79 | `ink_ok` | 31-33 | `1;38;5;82`. |
| `install_art.oo` | 79 | `ink_dim` | 35-37 | `38;5;244`. |
| `install_art.oo` | 79 | `ink_warn` | 39-41 | `1;38;5;214`. |
